天他真的问了你，你最想先告诉他哪一句？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2605,"promptTokens":166,"completionTokens":213,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:53:41"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":21,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"30c6be9b56b04576a7ccee668d3ba4f4","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.003172430650931862,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6affb63559efdd25482154bd","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795143221051,"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:53:41","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6affb63559efdd25482154bd","chatId":"5daf3433cdfc44e59ef05ee8c9666ff0","sessionId":null,"userId":129586,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"我可能更希望他私下来问我一句“怎么了”。不用多热情，至少让我知道他还在乎……但我又怕自己要求太多。其实在我家，大家都挺讲感受的，可我真开口时又总怕给别人添麻烦。<第10轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"30c6be9b56b04576a7ccee668d3ba4f4","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.003172430650931862,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6affb63559efdd25482154be","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795143221048,"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:53:41","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6affb62f59efdd25482154b1","chatId":"5daf3433cdfc44e59ef05ee8c9666ff0","sessionId":null,"userId":129586,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"听起来你不是真想放手，而是想被他看见、被挽留；他沉默让你又委屈又难堪，像自己在闹。你当时最希望他做的，是立刻私聊问你，还是直接来找你？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"au